---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /destinations/
title: Destinations
description: Every place on the site, filed by region and country, with the stays in each.
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <p class="label">{{ atlas.totals.countries }} countries · {{ atlas.totals.places }} places · {{ atlas.totals.stays }} stays</p>
  <h1 class="pagehead__title">Destinations</h1>
  <p class="pagehead__lede">
    Everything sorted by where it is rather than when I went. Pick a region,
    then a country, then a place. Every stay in it has its own review.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="dir">
  {%- for r in atlas.regions %}
  <article class="dir__region" data-reveal>
    <header class="dir__head">
      <h2 class="dir__title"><a href="{{ r.url }}">{{ r.name }}</a></h2>
      <p class="dir__count mono">{{ r.countryCount }} countries · {{ r.placeCount }} places · {{ r.stayCount }} stays</p>
    </header>
    <p class="dir__blurb">{{ r.blurb }}</p>
    <ul class="chiplist">
      {%- for c in r.countries %}
      <li><a class="chip" href="{{ c.url }}">{{ c.name }} <span class="mono">{{ c.placeCount }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </article>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
